<Information title="Privacy" description="Hosting, analytics and email privacy information for elixir.menu.">
<p>This notice covers the public website at elixir.menu. Linked products and services have their own privacy notices.</p>
<h2>Hosting and analytics</h2>
<p>Cloudflare Pages serves this website. Delivery and security providers receive the network information needed to respond to web requests. Read the <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare privacy policy</a> for its processing practices.</p>
<p>The homepage uses Plausible for website analytics. The About, Contact and Privacy pages do not load the Plausible script. Read the <a href="https://plausible.io/data-policy">Plausible data policy</a> for its measurement and storage practices.</p>
<h2>Email</h2>
<p>Contact links open your email client. If you email us, your message and the contact details you provide are handled through the email service used for that conversation. Please do not send passwords, access tokens or unnecessary sensitive information.</p>
<p>For a question or correction to this notice, email <a href="mailto:consulting@optimum.ba">consulting@optimum.ba</a>.</p>
<p>Site configuration reviewed 6 October 2026.</p>
</Information>
